Package: hmcX
Type: Package
Title: Collection of functions for HMC- and NUTS-sampling
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-09-05
Author: Steffen Nestler 
Maintainer: Steffen Nestler <steffen.nestler@uni-muenster.de>
Description: 
    Provides functions implementing a HMC-sampler and a NUTS-Sampler in R and C++. Define your own functions in R and C++ with CppAD to obtain Bayesian estimates with HMC or NUTS.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5)
Imports: 
    Rcpp, RcppEigen, stats, utils
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp, RcppEigen
License: GPL (>= 2)
